{'symbol': 'IFF', 'date': '2023-02-27 06:55:00', 'title': 'IFF ANNOUNCES FURTHER EVOLUTION OF ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--IFF (NYSE: IFF) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE NEXT PHASE OF THE EVOLUTION OF ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS, TO SUPPORT THE ONGOING EXECUTION OF THE COMPANY'S STRATEGIC TRANSFORMATION AND LONG-TERM FINANCIAL VISION. KEVIN O'BYRNE, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER AND DIRECTOR OF J SAINSBURY PLC, HAS BEEN APPOINTED TO JOIN THE IFF BOARD, EFFECTIVE MARCH 10, 2023."}